{{$help1 := print "## Collab Ad Staff Commands:\n"
"### Staff commands:\n"
"- `-ca help` - bring this help panel\n"
"- `-ca show <@user> [key]` - displays the user's collab ad template data\n"
"- - you can supply the `key` to only show that key value; run `-ca wandterms` or `-ca wandlist` for the valid keys\n"
"- - if no `key` argument is supplied, all values will be printed in JSON through a text file\n"
"- `-ca whitelist <@user>` - give bypass to the user if blocked by AutoMod\n"
"- `-ca cdoff <@user>` - removes the user's cooldown on bumping up or creating another collab ad template\n"
"- `-ca freeze <@user>` - freeze the user's collab ad\n"
"- `-ca unfreeze <@user>` - unfreeze the user's template; this command is also applicable if buttons and menus are disabled due to unfinished execution of the system\n"
"- `-ca rempost <@user>` - removes the user's collab ad post in their respective collab ad channels; this will also allow them to repost their collab ad\n"
"- `-ca wand <@user> remove <key>` - reset a value from the user's collab ad database to initial or empty state\n"
"- `-ca wand <@user> set <key> <value/s>` - set a value from the user's collab ad database; run `-ca wandterms` or `-ca wandlist` for the valid keys\n"
"- `-ca wandterms` or `-ca wandlist` - see the valid keys used for `-ca wand` and `-ca show` commands\n"
"- `-ca wandclear <@user>` - nuke user's database, template, and posted collab ad (if applicable)\n"
"- `-ca website list` - bring up websites allowed to be mask linked\n"
"- `-ca website add <url>` - adds a website allowed to be mask linked\n"
"- `-ca website remove <url>` - removes a website allowed to be mask linked\n"
"- `-ca automod list {nonlatin/basic/websites}` - bring up AutoMod terms disallowed for collab ads\n"
"- `-ca automod checkit <string>` - see if submitted string is in AutoMod\n"
"### Admin and head staff commands:\n"
"- `-ca automod add {nonlatin/basic/websites} <term>` - adds a term to AutoMod\n"
"- `-ca automod remove {nonlatin/basic/websites} <term>` - removes a term from AutoMod"}}
{{$help2 := print "```" ` Key  |Data Type|                  Description
-----------------------------------------------------------------
tID   |  int64  | thread ID of collab ad template
tmID  |  int64  | message ID of collab ad template
flag  |  string | <neutral>, <manageMedia>, <manageThumbnail>, <deleteCollab>, <freeze> => user status
AMod  |  string | <true>, <false>, <bypassed> => AutoMod status for Collab Description
term  |  string | what term got AutoModded for Collab Description

staff | boolean | :d
boost | boolean | :d
L20UP | boolean | Level 20+, Quality Control, Contributor, GD Mod, Event Winner, Legacy Leaderboard
CT    |  string | [100 characters] Collab Title
CP    |  string | [3900 characters] Collab Description

CI    |  string | [255 characters] Discord Invite
CC    |  string | [200 characters] Collab Contribution
CZ    |  string | <Small Scale Collab>, <Megacollab>, <Ultracollab> => Collab Size
LS    |  string | <Modern>, <Glow>, <Effect>, <Core>, <Art>, <Minigame>, <Neodesign>, <Layouts>, <Other> => Level Deco Style
CN    |  string | <Decoration Only>, <Gameplay Only>, <Decoration & Gameplay>, <Other> => Collab Needs

LD    |  string | <Non-Demon>, <Easy-Medium Demon>, <Hard-Insane Demon>, <Extreme Demon +> => Level Difficulty
LT    |  string | <Classic Mode>, <Platformer Mode> => Level Type
CS    |  string | <Low Standards>, <Medium Standards>, <High Standards> => Collab Standards
CH    |  string | [32 characters] Collab Host
LM    |  string | [500 characters] Level Music

CF    |  string | Collab Thumbnail, only media links are supported
CM    |  array  | Collab Media, each element is a string, each is separated by a space, only media links are supported
nID   |  int64  | Notification Message ID, ephemeral
nTok  |  string | Notification Token
fID   |  int64  | Forum ID of Posted Collab Ad

fmID  |  int64  | Message ID of Posted Colab Ad
time  |  int64  | [Unix] Timestamp of Collab Ad Post
no4WM |  int64  | Message ID of Non-Forwarded Media
no4WF |  int64  | Message ID of Non-Forwarded Thumbnail
msk   | boolean | If whether Collab Description has masked links

CTTM  |  int64  | [Unix] Timestamp when Collab Title was changed
nmID  |  int64  | Message ID For setting media and thumbnail
AMo2  |  string | <true>, <false>, <bypassed> = AutoMod status for Level Music
ter2  |  string | what term got AutoModded for Level Music` "```"}}

